---
title: "5.4.1 Sequence — notifikasi Midtrans sampai fulfillment"
---
sequenceDiagram
  participant MT as Midtrans<br/>(Snap + Status API)
  participant API as API webhook<br/>/v1/webhooks
  participant DB as Postgres<br/>(orders, seats, outbox)
  participant WK as Worker<br/>(Queues + jobs)
  participant RS as Resend<br/>(email)
  MT->>+API: POST notifikasi pembayaran
  Note over API: Cek signature_key SHA512 (waktu-konstan)
  alt tanda tangan salah
    API->>DB: Simpan event tidak sah
    API-->>MT: 401
  else dedupe_key sudah ada
    API-->>MT: 200 tanpa efek (duplikat)
  else peristiwa baru
    API->>DB: INSERT payment_events
    API->>WK: Antrekan pemrosesan
    API-->>-MT: 200 dalam ≤ 5 detik
  end
  WK->>MT: GET Status API (order_id percobaan)
  MT-->>WK: transaction_status, gross_amount, IDR
  alt settlement / capture+accept dan jumlah = total
    WK->>DB: Transaksi: kunci order, paid, invoice, kursi held → active, tulis outbox
    DB-->>WK: outbox order.paid (dispatcher)
    Note over WK: Konsumen paralel: SUB, PRV, DOM, NTF, perubahan terjadwal
    WK->>RS: Email lunas + invoice
  else jumlah atau order tidak cocok
    WK->>DB: Tetap pending + tandai rekonsiliasi
    WK->>RS: Peringatan ke admin
  end
